  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We have added Azure Databricks notebook activity in Azure Data Factory. You can now operationalize your&nbsp;Databricks notebooks in Data Factory. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information, see:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/operationalize-azure-databricks-notebooks-using-data-factory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blog announcement</a></li>\r\n <li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-factory/transform-data-using-databricks-notebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Getting-started tutorial</a></li>\r\n <li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/data-factory/transform-data-databricks-notebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Databricks activity documentation</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We have added Azure Databricks notebook activity in Azure Data Factory. You can now operationalize your Databricks notebooks in Data Factory.\n\nFor more information, see:\n\nBlog announcement\n\nGetting-started tutorial\n\nDatabricks activity documentation"
